      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PSIONIC PROWESS (1) has a strong record here with five wins and four placings from 14 starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (25.45) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks the one to beat with even luck. SHE'S A SHOW (7) was a winner two back when prominent throughout then got further back last time and could manage only a 5.5 lengths 5th at Q Straight (16.99). The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. One of the better hopes. STAYING ALIVE (4) could manage only third at this track last time but impressed when clocking a solid 19.69 over 352m at this track the start prior. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. SHE'S NO LADY (2) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (19.98) in a Grade 5 at this track last time out.",
